OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Facross southern and southeastern
OL,7,FEngland. Cloudier elsewhere with
OL,8,Foutbreaks of showery rain moving
OL,9,Fnortheastwards, perhaps turning
OL,10,Fthundery at times. A rather warm and
OL,11,Fhumid night to come, especially across
OL,12,FEngland and Wales.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FOutbreaks of heavy rain in
OL,15,Fthe north with the risk of thunder.
OL,16,FScattered showers in the south with
OL,17,Fthe odd thunderstorm. Vary warm and
OL,18,Fhumid. Windy in the north.
